/name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2009</year>) <article-title>Clinical features of human influenza A (H5N1) infection in Vietnam: 2004&#x02013;2006</article-title>. <source>Clin Infect Dis</source><volume>48</volume>: <fpage>1639</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1646</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19435433</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0078750-PerezPadilla1"><label>9</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Perez-Padilla</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name>, <name><surname>de la Rosa-Zamboni</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Ponce de Leon</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Hernandez</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Quinones-Falconi</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2009</year>) <article-title>Pneumonia and respiratory failure from swine-origin influenza A (H1N1) in Mexico</article-title>. <source>N Engl J Med</source><volume>361</volume>: <fpage>680</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>689</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19564631</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0078750-Yuen1"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Yuen</surname><given-names>KY</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Peiris</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Tsang</surname><given-names>DN</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Que</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>1998</year>) <article-title>Clinical features and rapid viral diagnosis of human disease associated with avian influenza A H5N1 virus</article-title>. <source>Lancet</source><volume>351</volume>: <fpage>467</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>471</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9482437</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0078750-Lin1"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Lin</surname><giv